ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/cd4f8a56ef3a80db5b8880750bbbd1c1.poster.avif?t=1754991536\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/cd4f8a56ef3a80db5b8880750bbbd1c1.webm?t=1754991536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144230/extras/cd4f8a56ef3a80db5b8880750bbbd1c1.mp4?t=1754991536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Modern Warships regularly receives new battle maps, combat vehicles and weapons while in-game tournaments, events and other activities provide new gaming experience and cover the subject of modern naval and air battles from different perspectives.",
